<title>BRAZIL: Merrill names Audi to head Brazil research.</title>
<headline>Merrill names Audi to head Brazil research.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc has hired Marcelo Audi to head its equity research team in Brazil, an official at the brokerage said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Audi, previously equity research chief at Banco Patrimonio, will fill a post last held by Paulo Vasconcellos, who left Merrill in August to rebuild ING Barings' Brazilian research department.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 55-11-248-5412</p>
